{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":430,"timestamp":"2026-07-26T10:24:27.406369Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"13428e94-0f19-465d-be47-fb829e70990a","comment_uuid":"b66d376f-0659-4b5f-aa18-8aa4430407c9","author":"xqjG","content":"ROUND 4 RETURNED (narrowed 3 lenses, uninterrupted, IN BAND: 269,534 tokens / 144 tools against 120k-240k — a hair over, the narrowed calibration holding). Verdicts: #789/#790/#791 held on their named sites per the security lens, but SE and QE found the round-3 fix pass under-tested and incomplete-by-enumeration in TWO dimensions. Stop: NOT reached, unanimous. THE LESSON, stated: rounds 3 and 4 both caught the same anti-pattern in my fixes — fixing a CLASS member-by-member at the sinks (the char set enumerated, the registry strings cleaned one at a time) leaves the rest of the class open for the next round. Round 4's fixes go at the class level. Four children: #793 (major, security+QE: is_terminal_unsafe enumerates a fixed list and misses WORD JOINER U+2060, invisible operators U+2061-2064, U+180E, interlinear U+FFF9-FFFB, the tag block U+E0000-E007F, and line/para separators U+2028-2029 — all demonstrated reaching the human form on the built binary; fix by Unicode General_Category, not a hand-list), #794 (major, SE+QE: the registry strings truncation_mark, absence_text, marker_word, broken_state_mark reach the terminal raw — the rest of the class #791 fixed only two members of; fix once at registry load so every surface including the machine form gets clean data), #795 (major, SE+QE: three falsifiers from round 3 do not falsify — the #790 command-level stderr test's malformed-config fixture cannot echo an escape byte so raw-vs-cleaned is indistinguishable, the #789 path-line fix has no hostile-path fixture, and registered_absence's expect is unpinned), #796 (minor: the init/preflight command surface prints cwd/tool-versions/init-errors outside the shared cleaner — a Layer 4 Install surface, carried there with the cleaner available, not a Layer 3 status surface). TELEMETRY, chosen versus observed: model chosen=observed claude-fable-5 all three; effort chosen=observed (security/SE high, QE medium); band 120k-240k, 269,534 observed. Fix pass follows — both class-level fixes plus the real falsifiers; adds one minimal pure-data dependency (unicode-general-category) with a justification doc per the estate's docs/dependencies gate, flagged for operator awareness.","created_at":"2026-07-26T10:24:27.392074Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA0QbyZ0DKwFjwvo4dZ01vxSgULvT3LCSuD0tZ/7i7YhMX1UKM9vibzCBqW5AX8oZuQ3Sj25ftZylCgve9hJZpCQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQO5Kre02/CLIbuE34bUqGvOzTCpq1MQ1J6ZNnEAJK8pGho4xvTumzinOfRaJ80jyGFYb9lTC6PoF+NPyJ8Cjtww="}
