{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":515,"timestamp":"2026-07-27T20:04:40.145198Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"95e5dadc-0b23-4aa0-825f-82a3918c1f5b","comment_uuid":"6ced2dac-1410-4fff-97d2-98a5590d453f","author":"xqjG","content":"DIRECTIVE CLASSIFICATION of operator 'B' (2026-07-27): SPEC AMENDMENT — a re-decomposition. It amends the contract's Decomposition section (phase 1c) driven by the invariant-first principle (phase 1a/1b). Amend-then-act: the contract changes only through the design process, NOT a solo edit — doing it by hand would repeat the #808 deviation we are mid-remediating.\n\nVEHICLE: the estate's design affordance (the design workflow / skill), attended — 'design authoring the chassis design workflow' per the act-to-affordance map; hand-rolling an equivalent is the nonconformance this whole thread is about. Design is attended (operator present), so this runs collaboratively, then cold-reviewed under composition, then operator-ratified as the exit.\n\nCOMPOSITION (proposed; note it differs from the #806/#807 amendment-review composition because a re-decomposition is architecture-led): Solution Architect PRIMARY (decomposition, dependency analysis, the new ordering), Solution Owner (contract-change authority, scope), Documentation Reviewer + Technical Writer (prose, register, Revision line).\n\nSCOPE: (1) adopt invariant-first as a decomposition principle; (2) re-sequence so the enforcement spine — directive classification, the unrouted-findings + round-parity queries, the amendment-discipline gating — is built as early as true dependencies allow (or bootstrap-carried), minimizing the un-self-enforced base; (3) fold in the reverted #806 clauses (routing format-carry + invariant-first) as they find their proper home in the new order. PARKED, rides separately: #807 terminal-safety (a Status-requirement amendment, not decomposition) and the Layer-3 rebuild — both wait until this lands. Entering the design workflow now to author the amendment attended.","created_at":"2026-07-27T20:04:40.126713Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAqLRYuLLu/Wf2BhgCzxyningyu541Sv+eaiJzA8qtRKw+h4pJqkmQtN3hjL6OP9jiWMfcFaL3WVfGhDpb3Mr7BA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFtNXlN9P5bCMkAa1JyuW7z0bU9hAbSutJ8X2I1sS1LK6hC6DdPBUwOFk4B2Xf0qmSS57AjMs1LB9MA5eNt13A0="}
