{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":518,"timestamp":"2026-07-27T20:23:17.325811Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"95e5dadc-0b23-4aa0-825f-82a3918c1f5b","comment_uuid":"61e91a1b-6cd3-4f90-9152-3bc24753499a","author":"xqjG","content":"COLD REVIEW RETURNED — 4/4 lenses, unanimous REVISE-THEN-RATIFY (telemetry: 262,362 tokens, chosen=observed fable, SA/SO high + DR/TW medium; in band). All findings ACCEPTED into the revision. Convergent set:\n- BLOCKING (SA+SO, DR concurs): the draft moves the unrouted-findings query to Layer 2 but never amends the Status requirement's integrity-query ENUMERATION (the surface Layer 2 reports through) nor the Gates requirement body line — so the query would have no criterion home and the snapshot-schema audit would not cover it. FIX: add both as edited regions; the query joins the Status enumeration, giving it the Status-detection Layer-2 slice as its criterion home.\n- BLOCKING (SO): the routing carry as worded flags lawful disposition-closures (dismissed/hallucinated/consolidated) as malformed. FIX: scope the obligation to findings closing BY FIX or surviving open; disposition closures satisfy by their recorded disposition.\n- MAJOR: round-parity is double-homed too (Layer 6 lists BOTH siblings). FIX: rewrite the Layer 6 entry for both — Layer 6 delivers the gate COMMANDS consuming Layer 2's unrouted-findings and round-parity queries.\n- MAJOR (SA+SO): the Layer-2 increment footprint is understated — it needs a routing field on the snapshot (deny_unknown_fields today), an acquisition extension, the snapshot-schema audit-mirror re-pin, and a convergence-corpus kind-set extension, with its own fresh red-gate seed under the fix-scale gate (NOT the historical Layer 2 gate). FIX: name all four surfaces.\n- MAJOR (SO): forward-only never states the query's universe boundary for the pre-amendment closed-unrouted set. FIX: findings closed before the ratification boundary are outside the query's universe; the six-round deviation stands 