OT dependency-free — needs the Layer4/7 hook seam; buildable-now form is non-blocking detection. (B) mdatron fold-in has no migration path + crosses the repo boundary + breaks live CI — sequence separately (#816) may be cleaner.","created_at":"2026-07-29T00:41:34.772722Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAM3l//ccBcGIMfQrZy/3qZVD3XVElbeFUpgTSbwCZ26RP1DVAMioNBXUmHrwQLyrNCtjRLIbhC6Zr5QbiD4ZFCg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQA2XZ9diU/YPPkrrev4YEZpLXQEas58wR2vcEGehrgJGjiF/hLuQbopvLXFbdNl9lnRBQgVgI2cwNcJOoRKSCAk="}
