{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":637,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T01:11:31.298968Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"b1e8ac84-f4a2-4a1e-bf12-b5b73d5d604b","comment_uuid":"3469191f-9e49-44c1-8c6b-f7121a223d48","author":"xqjG","content":"PHASE-4 ROUTING (route before fixing; operator triage = fix-now, defect lane). Three shipped agent-context-integrity vulns from the Red Team wider eval (#817), each with correct-artifact reasoning + the design control it seeds:\n1. FORGEABLE-STATE ENVELOPE [blocking] — read_state validates only schema/shape; GateResult.evidence is a free string never resolved; derive emits next_action=enter-next-phase on a self-authored last_gate_result{result:pass}. Correct artifact: the derivation/machine form must not present a state-sourced gate verdict as verified. FIX now: mark phase/gate provenance as unverified-self-report in the machine envelope (and human form) until evidence resolves to a real boundary commit. Seeds controls REQ-2/REQ-4.\n2. FALSE-ASSURANCE [substantive] — the report emits integrity_findings:[] when the finding/manifest/comment checks are DORMANT (inputs acquire empty until the Layer-6 join), read as checked-clean. FIX now: three-valued could-not-check — the report distinguishes checks-run-clean from checks-dormant (a checks-run vs checks-dormant manifest on the machine + human forms). Seeds control REQ-8.\n3. PROSE-INJECTION [substantive] — clean_for_terminal strips invisible Unicode only; a hostile state.yaml key or git commit subject flows cleaned-but-intact into the agent-consumed broken-state diagnostic. FIX now: frame echoed external content as quoted-untrusted (a typed field the agent is told not to interpret as instruction), bound its length; keep the actionable branch on the enumerated kind. Seeds the visible-content companion to terminal-output-safety.\nSequence: fix 1 -> 3 -> 2 (blocking first; 2 is the most invasive). Red-gate each. v3 records these as the controls realized forms.","created_at":"2026-07-29T01:11:31.283897Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA3OzYLBRJJdXKwtbH+I52GKuXbR0xTl3DGAfkp4fLACOWDxnVh/w+gG5jauH6bSudqRY6mJOHboz7Fm7y/7gvDA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPn1nxh3KOdvoakqdo1YBtG8gKs6jI78Z8rtQegQjLLZcHgtgcwMu9PC97HiF3RQaCMvQW5XqJ5y7v2luYxHVwI="}
{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":638,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T01:18:37.274540Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"b1e8ac84-f4a2-4a1e-bf12-b5b73d5d604b","comment_uuid":"fc6c376e-4be2-481e-8972-0ff6949d0b39","author":"xqjG","content":"FIX 3 (prose-injection) DONE — commit 498eb526. broken.rs bounds the echoed quote (QUOTED_MAX 512 + worded truncation) and the machine form carries quoted_content_untrusted:true; actionable signal stays on the enumerated kind. Red-gate test broken_state_bounds_and_marks_untrusted_quoted_content (green; would have failed pre-fix). Workspace 0 failed, clippy clean. REMAINING: Fix 1 (forgeable-state envelope provenance — touches derive/PhaseAnswer, baseline-adjacent) and Fix 2 (false-assurance dormant-vs-clean — touches acquire/derive/report, the most invasive); both more control-shaped, to red-gate with care.","created_at":"2026-07-29T01:18:37.257382Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAAd7X1jN+xr97jW7C6clT50qA++fDjF6FzDHeGYSUcNJfX7wdbhlw1MyukPKTXR/2XrT1sZfRoj855YFi0GR5Bg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAWBmaR6vScyO/KggdMkmNum+zs3er8EBZ0lGPwyo7WWQlksWUfdou+cDanBDfiHmmm6IjYxx9yPKHIhJXxVyAA="}
{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":639,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T01:24:12.670465Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"6b24050a-4513-4856-895f-71388315fa63","comment_uuid":"0319460c-04c6-4990-be06-bc04e7d7be13","author":"xqjG","content":"V3 WRITTEN — folds all three review passes + the four decisions. Key changes over v2: (1) the FORCING-SEAM correction — the now-built detection binds to seams that exist today (git pre-commit + session-stop hook) so deviation produces compiler-shaped feedback = enforcement, not the advisory latent-record both Red Team adversaries flagged; (2) REQ-1 gains an EXTERNAL HEARTBEAT so the audit is not exempt from its own discipline; (3) REQ-2 traces are tamper-evident by CORROBORATION (git + signed remote tracker), not local git alone; (4) REQ-3 closes the disposition-closure and fix-with-no-owning-finding routing bypasses with named non-forgeable halves; (5) REQ-4 phase gating resolves gate evidence to a boundary commit + marks unverified self-report (Fix 1 shape); (6) REQ-8 fail-closed distinguishes checks-run-clean from dormant/could-not-check reconciled with benign-offline (Fix 2 shape), enumerates the mis-rooted-session + --no-verify bypasses with the server-side-CI qualifier, slow-hook fails closed; (7) REQ-10 re-pin requires re-review; (8) NEW REQ-12 escape-vector coverage table (control + non-forgeable trace + enforcement-vs-advisory per corpus escape); (9) honest live-dormant note on #811/the Layer-2 queries; (10) the Revision-line lens count reconciled (7 lenses, DR+TW combined) and the six-round/rounds-1-5 wording fixed. 12 REQ, 12 AC, 0 open. Knowledge + pipeline synced. NEXT: terminal verify of v3, then ratification, then build Fixes 1+2 against the ratified shapes.","created_at":"2026-07-29T01:24:12.655539Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAAB