{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":640,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T01:26:39.546897Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"6b24050a-4513-4856-895f-71388315fa63","comment_uuid":"207c3a51-db84-4bf3-b43f-30bba3f1873d","author":"xqjG","content":"TERMINAL VERIFY of v3 (declared before spend). Vehicle: Workflow, 3 lenses on Opus 4.8 (Fable capped), HIGH effort: solution-architect (forcing-seam respects true deps; escape-vector table coherent, no double-home; heartbeat placement; delta over #810; now-built detection is compiled-binary no-init-dep), security (is tamper-evidence-by-corroboration REAL per-trace not just phrasing; fail-closed reconciled with benign-offline; bypass enumeration complete incl. mis-rooted-session/--no-verify/server-CI qualifier/slow-hook-fails-closed; disposition + fix-no-finding closed with non-forgeable halves; re-pin requires re-review), red-team (re-walk the top escapes against v3 — does the forcing-seam binding shift the gradient so deviation produces compiler-shaped feedback, or still escapable; is the audit heartbeat gap closed; fresh golden_path_verdict). Clean -> ratification; residual -> fix + re-verify. expected_cost_band: 0-8 open findings, 150k-300k tokens.","created_at":"2026-07-29T01:26:39.531641Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAHrykRPg3GflrQmT5DqkJhGMEoA7D+Ylq6gSbpK0lH+WyNMr0fv8mClvXjwE1bj7skFEJL9Ei6fFk2usTQ738CA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMWRbT28B4CprN09qdYkuhQMLfV5OuWCbZYHu83XkVOYLmUk+ksRD8+nNr0NkZXcYceVFGMwkQbm3BfQoThyswg="}
{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":641,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T01:32:50.228342Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"211eda62-996e-45f9-9c02-92149684df45","comment_uuid":"bd3caf39-2e92-4cdc-95bd-f322ae2292a5","author":"xqjG","content":"vsdd-cli PRACTICE ADOPTION for mdatron's own development (operator direction 2026-07-28). Adopt the vsdd METHODOLOGY practices, not the vsdd TOOL (not at alpha; its enforcement is live-dormant). KEY INSIGHT: mdatron does not need the vsdd-cli tool to ENFORCE these practices — mdatron IS a conformance engine, so it can enforce the vsdd record-conventions on its own development using mdatron itself plus git hooks. LOAD-BEARING LESSON from this session's Red Team: practices as CONDUCT ALONE drift — deviation is cheaper than compliance and the human becomes the only gate (how every escape in our corpus happened, mine included). So adopt the practices AND bind the enforceable ones to a forcing seam.\n\nPRACTICES (conduct): (1) phase discipline — 1a spec-review-loop, 1b verification-architecture, 1c decomposition, 2a red-gate, 2b implement-to-green, 2c exit-gate, 3 adversarial cold review, 4 ROUTE findings, 5 harden, 6 exit; layers/phases are crosslink milestones, exits are boundary commits + typed result comments. (2) ROUTE FINDINGS BEFORE FIXING (the #1 lesson) — every finding routes to the phase that would have prevented it before any fix; a fix-close with no prior routing plan is malformed; never grind fix-in-place. (3) owned/reviewed spec changes — never hand-edit the governing DESIGN solo; a spec change re-enters 1a under a declared composition + cold multi-lens review; operator ratification is the EXIT, not a substitute for the process. (4) crosslink discipline — issue-before-code; typed comments; findings carry owner+validator; closures carry evidence or a disposition. (5) naming/register — no coined labels, letter-clusters, or all-caps tokens; plain names; a durable term is a registration act.\n\nENFORCEMENT (mechanize with what mdatron already has — conduct alone drifts): use mdatron's own engine (rules/patterns over the design + tracker record estate) + the git pre-commit + a session-stop hook to make the key disciplines non-optional, so deviation produces compiler-shaped feedback at the act, not a latent record — e.g. an mdatron rule flagging a round-result comment missing its child-issue handle citations (parity); a pre-commit refusing a governed-DESIGN change whose commit evidence section does not cite the ratified review (amendment discipline); a check that a fix-close finding carries a prior routing plan. Bind, do not just document.\n\nHONEST BOUNDARY: the parts that need the vsdd-cli tool — the phase-answer derivation, the process-integrity status queries, the mechanized gate commands — are not shippable yet; keep those as conduct + cold review until vsdd-cli ships; do not wait on the tool for the rest.\n\nREUSE OUR ESCAPE CORPUS as mdatron's regression seeds: detection-without-a-seam is advisory; fix-in-place; relabel a fix-close as a disposition to dodge routing; fix with no owning finding filed before the commit; forge a self-authored gate/composition record; edit the checker itself. If mdatron's seams do not catch each, they are insufficient.\n\nRELAY CAVEATS: (1) mdatron likely already does some of this (ran cold reviews for us, has a tracker) — this is aligning + mechanizing, not replacing; (2) the vsdd phase primers and domain prompts are deployable artifacts if mdatron wants to load them directly rather than paraphrase.","created_at":"2026-07-29T01:32:50.210627Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA++8pa0Urxl06XSvUq5xpuQxBZ7byx5W93N5EW0I+lgd/k0E0PRA4ZfM/+80S+WqKYd8h5hBqeUoQhovi2mzTAA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCg5XKyYedQhV2jEa2dcp7mjqMi3vNkgOE6CxmzXW1vd4WHm2f1zTExcAOJ3JDKNgs/398FD73JvZXlQP4IPTA8="}
{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":642,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T01:36:11.878613Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"6b24050a-4513-4856-895f-71388315fa63","comment_uuid":"3da4f641-7470-4194-b86a-6c6cb5ab7518","author":"xqjG","content":"V3 TERMINAL VERIFY — 3/3 needs-another-round; Red Team golden_path STILL not-the-easy-path. THE DECISIVE FINDING (Red Team verified against the actual repo): v3s load-bearing correction — the now-built controls bind to forcing seams that EXIST TODAY — is FALSE AS BUILT. Repo facts: .githooks/pre-commit runs mdatron verify on staged markdown/schema/pattern files only and exits 0 for source commits (a .rs fix commits with ZERO checks), and mdatron has no tracker/finding/routing/gate awareness, so it CANNOT refuse a governed-set commit while an unrouted/ungated finding stands; NO session-stop/SessionEnd hook exists anywhere; the crosslink sentinel (the REQ-1 heartbeat) is enabled:false; .vsdd/state.yaml does not exist. The seam has nothing to force on and is not wired — the advisory-not-enforcement gap the prior adversaries flagged, papered over by a factual misstatement about the built system rather than closed.\nOTHER BLOCKERS/SUBSTANTIVE: SA — the escape-vector table marks unrouted-findings Enforced-now, contradicting the live-dormant admission (the query needs the Layer-6 tracker-join). Security — REQ-7 says git is a truth leg not agent-editable, contradicting REQ-2 git-leg-is-rewritable; tamper-evidence-by-corroboration is otherwise substantially real. Heartbeat per-act half under-specified + sentinel disabled. Minors: delta overstatements (fix-with-no-owning-finding is ALREADY a ratified contract falsifier, line 83; compiler-shaped feedback is already the contract goal, Summary line 10); disposition-rate is a heuristic; filing-timestamp is agent-controllable locally.\nTHE CONVERGED TRUTH (three adversarial rounds): there is NO forcing seam today; making the golden path the easy path requires BUILDING enforcement, and the routing/finding disciplines genuinely cannot be enforced now because their Layer-2 tracker-join is dormant until Layer 6. Only the LIVE-DATA disciplines (git-resolved phase-gate/boundary-commit; commit-evidence owning-finding; refs/session-substrate) are enforceable-now, and only if a real seam is BUILT (the existing pre-commit does not do it). This reopens dogfood decision (A): bind-to-a-seam requires BUILDING the seam, not wiring an existing one.","created_at":"2026-07-29T01:36:11.862910Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAXOXTqVnacgzfxiihus0A1VCnHc3gn9RsuffWvCfoE/GeK7oUSqgVQdRRPPXndTfs1B1xms6C6OJ148I9TgKPAA=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKAuCnFavu3ym6u0uCoeUOdvuZPpYISaBOaRXZ07V8uJK3NA4W39POrf+SGGZeab5uZF1ZfAppDszF9YNCJOTAc="}
{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":643,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T01:44:11.332755Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"6b24050a-4513-4856-895f-71388315fa63","comment_uuid":"9d365e43-96d3-43e3-9ea5-1990ad48f49b","author":"xqjG","content":"PAUSED to feed a re-decomposition (operator direction 2026-07-28). The v3 terminal verify + both Red Team passes converged on a STRUCTURAL root cause: the horizontal component layers defer the enforcement substrate (esp. the tracker-join the Layer-2 queries need) to the back third, so enforcement is never live-early and every now-enforcement claim fails. The fix is not another design iteration against the current structure — it is a phase-1c RE-DECOMPOSITION to vertical capability slices (each buildable AND enforceable end-to-end). This design (#815) becomes an INPUT to that re-decomposition: its escape corpus, the forcing-seam finding, the live-dormant finding, and the enforcement-needs-live-data-early conclusion are the drivers. #815 resumes (or is superseded) after the re-decomposition ratifies. The #818 shipped-vuln fixes proceed independently (defect lane; Fix 3 done).","created_at":"2026-07-29T01:44:11.317102Z","kind":"decision","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAgP7q5uSygnrAC6zZOxhlh40ANW4N+ITW5d7u0Heg74aqjt11e7Hfnf+54V0Z6mDPIb4rx2EzZCqWv4lMlmiQBQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCM6sPK+jcsJTzh4j0ysqU/bDGMMA0rhblkSdFWXKBWzHoPYPF5VqUtw7mGS7klkTEumt7HnXq4iLEjrYsg+WAc="}
