{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":650,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T02:12:07.292173Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"193da836-d03a-41e7-90b8-a198752415ab","comment_uuid":"4ea1238a-6992-40d7-a5b9-8919fcc2bc92","author":"xqjG","content":"COLD REVIEW OUTCOME (7 lenses, Opus 4.8, wf_2263b29b-dd1): ALL SEVEN verdict=revise-before-ratify. Zero built-state fabrications — every reviewer's repo claim verified true (unpinned CI mdatron seam .github/workflows/mdatron-verify.yml; refs.rs is substrate; only Init/Status subcommands, status exits 0; acquire.rs:111-114 empty; mdatron 0.1.0/no config.yaml). Naming clean on all lenses (no coinage).\n\nCONVERGENT CORE DEFECT (SA+SO+Red-Team+QE+PE+AIE independently): the draft conflates DETECTION with ENFORCEMENT. 'Enforcement live at Slice 1 / none deferred / grows monotonically' overstates what a hand-extended .githooks/pre-commit delivers — it is bypassable (--no-verify, unset core.hooksPath, hand-edit, dormant in fresh clones), the non-bypassable gate command is still Slice 4, and the local tracker it reads is agent-writable (contradicts the contract's 'tracker is corroboration, never authoritative'). This is the assert-enforcement-that-isn't class caught 3x this session — caught again here, pre-ratification. The process worked.\n\nTRIAGE (route-before-fix):\nACCEPT+FIX in revision (mechanical/clearly-correct):\n- refs-query slice -> back to substrate (no tracker-join dep) [SA/SO]\n- self-governance seam: broaden def beyond .githooks/; name the actual trigger per slice (git/chassis/CI) [SA/PE]\n- 'none deferred' -> qualify: except cross-repo-gated seams, flagged per slice [SA/AIE]\n- phantom 'Status detection live-on-real-data' slice -> reclassify as operational increment (no fixture criterion), like the bookends [SA/SO/DR/QE]\n- bookend '[unchanged]' placeholders -> amend-by-splice (retain subsections unedited), no placeholder in normative text [SA/DR]\n- data-authoring scope -> 'substrate AND later-slice artifacts'; name which data feeds which slice [SA]\n- pre-ratification stamp -> 'ratification pending #819' until recorded [DR] (the memory lesson, again)\n- Revision-line entry + amendment-discipline evidence-cite in packaging notes [DR]\n- register 'substrate/forcing seam/self-governance seam/adopter seam' in draft-vocabulary (maturity lifecycle) [SO/QE/DR]\n- round-parity front-load lacks its data (launch/heartbeat = Slice 6): move round-parity to its true-dependency slice; keep only unrouted-findings (findings+plan comments) at Slice 1 [PE/QE]\n- cost: declare a per-commit seam wall-clock budget; split O(1) this-commit's-finding check (pre-commit) from O(n) universe scan (pre-push/boundary); add a 'coarsest act that still enforces' cost paragraph [AIE]\n- pre-commit can't see commit scope -> name the correct stage (commit-msg/boundary) or make scope-independent [Red Team]\n- minor DR: substrate-includes-data-package; lowercase 'estate-cleanup'; audit line enumerate full Status members\n\nROUTE to SO / phase-1a (NOT solo-editable — criterion edits):\n- dropped Status-detection state-consistency deep-history half (was L6) -> assign to Slice 4 + audit line [SO]\n- fresh-container gate has NO fixture + undefined smoke oracle; and payload-growth after one-shot Slice-4 gate -> either add a fixture (phase-1a criterion edit) or carry manual/live-fire-class with named owner [QE]\n\nROUTE to #816 / immediate estate:\n- unpinned CI mdatron install = standing build-blocker once sibling main hits v0.2.0; pin CI checkout to a tag/SHA + keep pre-commit 0.1.x window until #816 config.yaml lands [PE]\n\nOPERATOR DECISION (the one that reshapes the thesis): the enforcement reframe depth + how-radical. Presented next.","created_at":"2026-07-29T02:12:07.277895Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoL