{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":651,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T02:19:56.698852Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"193da836-d03a-41e7-90b8-a198752415ab","comment_uuid":"1db74b93-fb99-4a08-8e2a-d4a5d16b4be4","author":"xqjG","content":"REVISED per both operator decisions (2026-07-28): [1] enforcement reframe = deflate + CI backstop now; [2] scope = honest-scoped. Key changes to the draft:\n- Principle reframed: 'enforcement-spine-first' not 'radical vertical throughout'. Only Slice 1 is a genuine vertical; product slices stay component-cohesive (stated plainly, per SA finding).\n- THREE enforcement grades named honestly (detection / friction / CI-backed block); tamper-proof enforcement explicitly beyond all three and routed to #815's corroboration oracle (per Red Team). 'construction not convention' absolutism dropped.\n- Slice 1 closes NO fixture-based criterion (peer to bookends); it mechanizes the #810 routing format-carry. Delivers: live detection (tracker-join, with integration-test falsifiers), a friction seam at the commit-MSG stage (pre-commit can't see scope), and a CI backstop for the O(n) scan. Fails OPEN on tracker-unreachable (offline-git guarantee). Forgeable residual named + routed to #815.\n- refs-query slice -> back to substrate. Round-parity -> Slice 6 (needs launch/heartbeat data). Dropped state-consistency deep-history half -> restored to Slice 4. phantom Status-live slice -> reclassified as integration behavior.\n- self-gov seam broadened beyond .githooks: per-concern seam family with named triggers (git/chassis/CI/dispatch). one-check-two-seams drift hazard -> thin wrappers over one shared impl + a drift check. CI seams (verify+test, unpinned) inventoried.\n- 'none deferred' -> qualified (except cross-repo-gated); Slice 2 gets a vsdd bootstrap validation-at-read leg so it's live at landing.\n- cost: per-commit wall-clock budget; O(1) pre-commit / O(n) CI split.\n- mdatron/CI: config.yaml (#816) = standing cross-repo blocker (unpinned CI install), NOT a Slice-1 prereq; pin both seams; added as an enumerated estate-cleanup act.\n- amend-by-splice (no placeholders); ratification-pending stamp; Revision-line + terms-registration + evidence-cite in packaging notes.\n- fresh-container gate -> manual/live-fire class w/ named owner + defined smoke oracle; standing per-payload-slice obligation. Promotion to a fixture = routed phase-1a.\n\nTerminal verify dispatched (wf next), lenses re-checking their own prior findings + scanning for revision-introduced defects.","created_at":"2026-07-29T02:19:56.683065Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABALuIRzGKDVT2f8oGu+1BE2KEwEHJnAzepbgkRsdlO62eZO3QLSYmUK7vzfxRZX4jugakHqxZw3s3HfI3HYXnRCw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNN367JfKpMyKijdRC+AxJygaXDCxM9js2VRJmH+ssSS6ofrTcp6ddZSNCo/bYdVxozlCxYN5j6eihoozY+45QQ="}
{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":652,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T02:30:00.566440Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"193da836-d03a-41e7-90b8-a198752415ab","comment_uuid":"f741785f-fb77-415a-8a9d-90bdfebbe466","author":"xqjG","content":"Operator framing 2026-07-28 (2nd): the meta-harness today harnesses Claude Code CLI specifically, but can/will expand to GitHub Copilot and perhaps more. Design consequence — a PORTABILITY GRADIENT inversely correlated with the enforcement-grade ladder: grades 1-3 (convention/git-friction/CI-backed-block) are substrate-AGNOSTIC (git+CI+crosslink are universal); grade 4 (harness-level capability restriction, e.g. Claude Code sub-agent tool-restriction / dispatch withholding) is substrate-SPECIFIC. So the STRONGEST enforcement is the LEAST portable. Architectural discipline this implies (fold into the post-verify revision, NOT a new build now — one harness today, abstracting for a second is premature): keep the vsdd CORE (integrity queries, gates over git/CI, tracker integration, pure derivation) harness-agnostic; concentrate substrate-specifics (statusline wiring, hooks, dispatch/capability) behind the per-harness adapter the supplements+vehicle concept already provides (supplements/claude-code-cli.md today; a copilot supplement later). Mark the draft's seam family accordingly: git+CI = portable; chassis session-start/pre-tool hooks + dispatch = adapter-provided. The core/adapter boundary is hard-to-undo, so getting it harness-agnostic now is cheap; retrofitting later is expensive. Reinforces the deflate+CI decision: CI (grade 3) is the portable strong backbone; grade-4 degrades to grade-3 on a harness that lacks the primitive.","created_at":"2026-07-29T02:30:00.550312Z","kind":"decision","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAZsPT