{"agent_id":"xqjG","agent_seq":674,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T05:08:26.724388Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"ccced380-4c00-4475-bd76-75a386e41968","comment_uuid":"97f40d9c-0935-4a76-bef1-bef0e2989510","author":"xqjG","content":"RED GATE — increment 1 landed (working tree, verified red; NOT committed — avoids leaving main red mid-red-gate). Added 3 pure tracker-join mappers to vsdd-core/src/snapshot/acquire.rs with minimal bodies + failing-by-default tests in the acquire test module: routing_present(comment_kinds) [plan-kind = routing edge], is_finding(parent_labels) [parent labeled 'review' = a finding], closed_before_ratification(closed_at, boundary) [open + closed-at/after = in universe]. cargo test -p vsdd-core --lib snapshot::acquire::tests: 5 passed / 3 FAILED (the new ones), 0 vacuous — each fails on its named-behavior assertion, not a panic. Scope: crosslink-native enforcement-spine fields only (per the #820 scope decision); owner/validator/evidence deferred to Slice 5; round manifests/children/comment-handles deferred to Slice 6 (round-parity homes there).\n\nREMAINING red-gate pieces before the red-gate commit: (a) acquire_snapshot integration test over a real temp crosslink repo (proves the effectful shell wires findings->mappers); (b) guardrail block/pass tests (commit-msg hook + CI leg — script/manual-class, hand-carried at bootstrap). Then phase-2b implements the mapper bodies + the acquire assembly -> green; the vsdd-core->vsdd merge (#15) folds in at 2b entry.","created_at":"2026-07-29T05:08:26.710961Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQ6tbyGxjDfsNHdeOlMQZQaTJX9Ij1ckKVPX/DhibsJAAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAcjBSRnWIgVoMu1t00caEibKIAAsKgpQx7AV1rhF0UgbH0G62VKeWg5CQtOfofG6JKRDpqYPrl69Y2ZhO23tUDQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:v2ahqtq1cloiYtPHwSJByIfLW+KKRz5ElCE0sStkAow","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAA